# Local syncthing source mirror. Created by `make gen-assets` so we can
# drop the generated GUI assets file (gui.files.go) into its package — Go
# enforces module-cache integrity and rejects in-place edits there, and
# upstream syncthing's repo doesn't ship the generated file.
/backend/syncthing-fork/

